{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "机会教育/讲道理属于错误说教", "content": "机会教育、讲道理都属于错误说教的范畴，尤其高知家长喜欢一看到机会就对孩子讲道理。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["说教", "机会教育", "讲道理"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-217825eaba68", "blocks": ["b00001"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a003", "kind": "causes", "condition": "当父母进行机会教育或讲道理时", "reason": "说教容易导致父母与孩子情绪失联，因为孩子需要的不是说教，而是父母进入他的世界。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-217825eaba68-c001:u001"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "母亲随时机会教育的案例", "content": "讲师回忆自己的母亲：一起看电视时，即使广告与人不沾边，母亲也会拿来机会教育；一起逛街时，母亲会突然话锋一转，把话题转到讲师身上进行教育，导致讲师既想和母亲一起又害怕。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["机会教育", "案例", "亲子关系"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a002", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-217825eaba68", "blocks": ["b00002", "b00003"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a001", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "母亲的行为是机会教育的具体例子", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-217825eaba68-c001:u002"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "说教导致情绪失联", "content": "说教容易导致父母与孩子情绪失联，因为孩子需要的不是说教，而是父母进入他的世界、认识他、聆听他。当孩子刚表达一点情绪（如恨物理老师），父母立即开始教育，会堵住孩子后面想表达的情绪。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["说教", "情绪失联", "聆听"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a003", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-217825eaba68", "blocks": ["b00004", "b00005"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a001", "kind": "causes", "condition": "说教行为导致情绪失联", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a005", "kind": "causes", "condition": "长期说教导致情绪失联", "reason": "情绪失联导致孩子不愿敞开心扉，回家就关门。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a004", "kind": "supports", "condition": "说教时", "reason": "说教传递的信息是父母对孩子的感受不感兴趣，只对问题感兴趣。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a008", "kind": "contrasts", "condition": "对比说教与情绪连接", "reason": "说教导致情绪失联，而先情绪连接再讲道理更有效。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-217825eaba68-c001:u003"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "说教传递的信息：对感受不感兴趣", "content": "说教时，父母传递给孩子一个信息：我对你的感受不感兴趣，但对你的问题感兴趣，我们可以讨论解决问题的方法，但请不要告诉我你的情绪和感受。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["说教", "信息传递", "情绪"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a004", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-217825eaba68", "blocks": ["b00005", "b00006"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a003", "kind": "supports", "condition": "解释了说教导致情绪失联的机制", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-217825eaba68-c001:u004"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "consequence", "title": "情绪失联导致孩子不愿敞开心扉", "content": "孩子稍微长大一点，会出现非常剧烈的情绪失联，父母进不到孩子心里，孩子不愿敞开，回家就关门。父母想让孩子说心里话，但不知道孩子为什么不喜欢说。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["情绪失联", "青春期", "沟通"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a005", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-217825eaba68", "blocks": ["b00006", "b00007"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a003", "kind": "causes", "condition": "长期说教导致情绪失联，进而孩子不愿沟通", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-217825eaba68-c001:u005"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "心理辅导室中青少年愿意倾诉的案例", "content": "在心理辅导室，很多青少年叫讲师“讲者”，什么都愿意说，什么事情都敢说。讲师认为不是自己多厉害，而是因为能进入孩子的世界，和他一起经历情绪和感知。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["心理辅导", "共情", "青少年"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a006", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-217825eaba68", "blocks": ["b00007", "b00008"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a003", "kind": "contrasts", "condition": "与说教导致情绪失联相反，共情能建立连接", "evidence": "source_extraction", "reason": "案例中青少年因辅导者进入其世界而愿意倾诉，与说教导致情绪失联形成对照。", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": null}, {"target": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a007", "kind": "association", "condition": "角色与条件不同：案例发生在专业辅导室，目标在父母且限于无情绪问题时", "reason": "案例中的共情发生在专业辅导者与青少年之间，而目标强调父母在无情绪问题时的预防作用，场景和角色不一致，无法直接支持省钱结论。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "原支持关系不成立，改为关联"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-217825eaba68-c001:u006"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "父母进入孩子世界可省心理辅导费用", "content": "如果父母能做到进入孩子的世界，和孩子一起经历情绪和感知，可以省很多钱，避免将来花钱让孩子见心理辅导。但若孩子已有情绪问题，仍应见专业辅导。", "steps": [], "conditions": ["孩子没有情绪问题时，养成习惯可预防；已有情绪问题仍需专业辅导"], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["共情", "预防", "心理辅导"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a007", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-217825eaba68", "blocks": ["b00008", "b00009", "b00010"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a006", "kind": "association", "condition": "概念针对父母，案例针对专业辅导者，角色不同", "evidence": "source_extraction", "reason": "目标案例是专业辅导者进入孩子世界使青少年倾诉，而来源是父母进入孩子世界可省费用，二者角色条件不同，不能直接支持。", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "原支持关系不成立，改为关联"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-217825eaba68-c001:u007"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "先情绪连接，再讲道理", "content": "父母应先与孩子情绪连接，孩子准备好了，很多道理一句话就可以讲过来，不需要长篇大论。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["情绪连接", "讲道理", "沟通顺序"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a008", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-217825eaba68", "blocks": ["b00010"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a003", "kind": "supports", "condition": "情绪连接是避免情绪失联的方法", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "legacy:gj-c-07", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：先连接情绪再讲道理时。", "reason": "直接补充 legacy limits：父母应先与孩子情绪连接，孩子准备好了，很多道理一句话就可以讲过来，不需要长篇大论。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:gj-c-21", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "共同适用：讨论管教节奏是先连接情绪还是先讲道理时。", "reason": "两者一致：先情绪连接，孩子准备好后再讲道理，不需长篇大论。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:xg-c-12", "kind": "complements", "condition": "均涉及处理孩子情绪时的步骤；旧原子强调先与自己的情绪连接，再谈孩子的情绪，候选提供先连接后讲道理的顺序。", "reason": "候选提出父母应先与孩子情绪连接，孩子准备好了，很多道理一句话就可以讲过来，不需要长篇大论，补充了旧原子中“先与自己的情绪连接，再谈孩子的情绪”的具体操作。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:xg-r-04", "kind": "complements", "condition": "两者均讨论讲道理与情绪连接的顺序；旧原子说讲道理替代连接有问题。", "reason": "候选补充正确顺序：先连接后讲道理。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-217825eaba68-c001:u008"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "consequence", "title": "说教让孩子觉得父母不真实、无聊", "content": "说教的另一个坏处是孩子会非常讨厌父母，因为觉得父母不真实、无聊，像没有情感的机器人，只会发现问题、解决问题；而父母讲道理时自己感觉良好（自嗨），孩子却觉得无法进行情绪沟通。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我认知"], "tags": ["说教", "真实性", "亲子关系"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a009", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-217825eaba68", "blocks": ["b00011", "b00012", "b00013"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a003", "kind": "supports", "condition": "说教导致情绪失联，进而让孩子觉得父母不真实", "evidence": "source_extraction", "reason": "说教让孩子觉得父母不真实、无聊，同时也会导致情绪失联，两者相互补充说明说教负面影响。", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": null}, {"target": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a010", "kind": "supports", "condition": "父母说教显得不真实", "reason": "来源指出说教让孩子觉得父母不真实无聊，目标说明不真实的父母无法与提供丰富情绪的电子产品竞争，来源为目标提供解释。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "原 kind 为 causes，改为 supports"}, {"target": "legacy:gj-c-07", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：父母说教导致孩子情绪失联时。", "reason": "补充后果细节：孩子会非常讨厌父母，觉得父母不真实、无聊、像没有情感的机器人，与 legacy 的“觉得父母不真实、不愿再表露内心”一致。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-217825eaba68-c001:u009"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "comparison", "title": "电子产品提供丰富情绪，父母讲道理无法竞争", "content": "手机游戏、网络内容都做得真实，与孩子有情绪连接，提供千千万万种丰富情绪。而活生生的世界里有一个不真实、讲道理的父母，所以父母无法与电子产品竞争，主动输给机器。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["依赖与失控"], "tags": ["电子产品", "情绪连接", "竞争"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a010", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-217825eaba68", "blocks": ["b00013", "b00015", "b00016"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-217825eaba68-c001:a009", "kind": "supports", "condition": "父母不真实导致孩子转向电子产品寻求情绪满足", "evidence": "source_extraction", "reason": "目标中“说教让孩子觉得父母不真实、无聊”与来源中“不真实、讲道理的父母”一致，支撑说教效果。", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": null}], "knowledge_units": ["s-217825eaba68-c001:u010"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
